          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምጽዋት ፡ አያጸድቅም ፡ አሉህን ፡ ገበሬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዕርበተ ፡ ፀሐይ ፡ በፊት ፡ ሥራውን ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈታልን ፡ እንደዚህስ ፡ ከሞት ፡ አስቀድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መህ ፡ ምጽዋቱን ፡ ለምን ፡ ተውህ ፡ ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለቱ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ነስሕ ፡ እንከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ፡ ተመለስ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእመ ፡ አኮሰ ፡ እመጽእ ፡ ወአድለቀልቃ ፡ ለማኅቶ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትከ ፡ እምነ ፡ መካና ፡ እመ ፡ ኢነሳሕከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያለዚያ ፡ ግን ፡ ባትመለስ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወከመ ፡ ቀዲሙ ፡ ግብረከ ፡ እመ ፡ ኢገበርከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ፡ቀድሞው ፡ ሥራህን ፡ ባትሠራ ፡ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መዓት ፡መጥቼ፡ ሕዝቡን፡ከኤፌሶን፡ አጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፋቸዋለሁ፡ ሐተታ፡ ሕዝቡ፡ ቢጠፉ፡ እሱ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምን ፡ ይጎዳል ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ሕዝቡ ፡ ከጠፉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በማን፡ ላይ፡ ይሾማል ። አንድም ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወበከመ ፡ ካህን ፡ ከማሁ ፡ ሕዝብኒ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዲል፡ ግብረ፡ አበር ፡ ናቸውና ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሹመትህን፡ ከማዕርጓ፡ አዋርዳታለሁ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ነፍስህን ፡ ከሥጋህ ፡ እለያታለሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፮ ፤ ⟪ወዘንቱሰ ፡ ብከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህን ፡ ግን ፡ ይዘሃል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ትጸልእ፡ ምግባሮሙ ፡ ለኒቆላውያን ፡ በከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አነ ፡ እጸልእ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ፡ እንድጠላ ፡ የኒቆላውያንን ፡ ግብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትጠላለህና ። ሐተታ፡ እሊህ፡ ኒቆላውያን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግብረ ፡ ሰዶም ፡ የሚሠሩ ፡ ጥምቀት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሠላሳ ፡ ዘመን ፡ ግዝረት ፡ ባርባ ፡ ዘመን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚሉ ፡ የኒቆላዎስ ፡ ፈላሲ ፡ ዘሀገረ ፡ አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጾኪያ ፡ ደቀ ፡ መዛሙርት ፡ ናቸው ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ህስ ፡ ቢሆን ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡ በዘመኑ ፡ ነበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩና ፡ ብዙ ፡ ድርሰት ፡ በደረሱ ፡ ብዙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተግሣጽ ፡ በጻፉ ፡ ነበረ ፡ ብሎ ፡ ሌላ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስም ፡ አበር፡ ቍ፡ ፲፭ ። መዝ ፡ ፻፵፱፥፳፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፯ ፤ ⟪ዘቦ ፡ እዝን ፡ ሰሚዐ ፡ ለይስማዕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኒቆላውያን፡ ግብር ፡ ድል፡ የነሣ፡ እንዳይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጎዳ ፡ ድል ፡ ያልነሣ ፡ እንዲጎዳ ፡ እዝነ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቡና ፡ ያለው ፡ ሰው ፡ ያስተውል ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ፍቅረ ፡ ንዋይን ፡ በፍቅረ ፡ ቢጽ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድል ፡ የነሣ ፡ እንዳይጎዳ ፡ ድል ፡ ያል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሣ ፡ እንዲጎዳ ፡ እዝነ ፡ ልቡና ፡ ያለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ያስተውል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ምንተ ፡ ይቤ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ለአብያተ ፡ ክርስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቲያናት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላለቃውስ ፡ ይህን ፡ ተናገረ ፡ ለሕዝቡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምን ፡ ተናገረ ፡ ትለኝ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ላለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃው ፡ የተናገረው ፡ ለሕዝቡም ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም፡ ላለቃው፡ የተናገረ፡ ለሕዝቡም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለዘሞዐሰ ፡ እሁቦ ፡ ይብላዕ ፡ እምውስተ ፡ ዕፀ ፡ ሕይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወት ፡ ዘሀሎ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ገነቱ ፡ ለአምላኪየ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኒቆላውያንን ፡ ግብር፡ ድል፡ ለነሣ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ፍቅረ ፡ ንዋን ፡ በፍቅረ ፡ ቢጽ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድል ፡ ለነሣ ፡ በፈጣሪዬ ፡ ገነት ፡ ካለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕፀ ፡ ሕይወት ፡ ይበላ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ እሰጠዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለሁ ፡ አለ ፡ ከፈጣሪዬ ፡ የምትገኝ ፡ ልጅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነትን ፡ እሰጠዋለሁ ። አንድም ፡ በፈጣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሪዬ ፡ ሰውነት ፡ ያለ ፡ ሥጋውን ፡ ደሙን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሰጠዋለሁ ። አንድም ፡ በፍቅሩ ፡ ተሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውራ ፡ ያለች ፡ ፍቅሩን ፡ እሰጠዋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቍ ፡ ፲፩ ፥ ፲፯ ፥ ፳፮ ። ም ፡ ፫ ፥ ፭ ፥ ፲፪ ፥፳፩።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፳፪ ፥ ፪ ። ዘፍጥ ፡ ፪ ፥ ፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪ወጸሐፍ ፡ ሎቱ ፡ ለመልአከ ፡ ቤተ ፡ ክርስቲ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ ዘሴሜርኔስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
